### R-print / R-log — skip-check emit

| Shape | emit-c | check | emit-llvm |
|-------|--------|-------|-----------|
| `print(SECRET)` | rc=0 `oo_print_str` (llvm builtin `print`) | type `undefined variable 'print'` | rc=0 `@oo_print_str` (s3cret in IR) |
